* BSS138 N-MOSFET, behavioural model built from the onsemi datasheet typical values:
* VGS(th) 1.3 V typ (0.8..1.5 V), RDS(on) ~1.3 ohm @ VGS=3.3 V, Ciss 27 pF, Coss 13 pF, Crss 6 pF, body diode.
.subckt BSS138 D G S PARAMS: VTH=1.3
M1 D G S S NMOD L=1u W=1u
.model NMOD NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO={VTH} KP=0.4 LAMBDA=0.01)
Cgs G S 21p
Cgd G D 6p
Cds D S 7p
Dbody S D DBODY
.model DBODY D (IS=1e-12 N=1.1 RS=0.05 TT=5n)
.ends
